      "writtenOn": "2020-01-06T18:08:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I watched your tech talk about it last year - I\u0027ll try to give this a shot, doesn\u0027t seem like it\u0027s too much work to change this. (Might end up doing it in a later CL as our IC deadline is Jan 19th and there\u0027s one or two pieces of functionality that still needs to be finished.)",
