      },
      "lineNbr": 7,
      "author": {
        "id": 1120458
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-10T19:42:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Keep in mind that it would be much easier to switch now than later. As anything that is written from now on will have to be changed, and if it doesn\u0027t happen this release, it\u0027s likely we\u0027ll have to maintain a HIDL + AIDL version for several years. Further, AIDL will allow you to do things like add enumerations to the interface in place, rather than having to extend this interface w/ new methods.",
